  { q: 'What is the Best Answer Hub Salary Converter?', a: 'The Best Answer Hub Salary Converter is a free, browser-based tool that converts pay between hourly, weekly, biweekly, semi-monthly, monthly, and yearly in real time. It blends overtime at time-and-a-half, adjusts for the weeks you actually work, and compares W-2 salary against 1099 contract pay. It needs no account and sends nothing to a server.' },
