  { q: 'What is the federal minimum wage in 2026?', a: 'The federal minimum wage is $7.25 an hour, unchanged since July 2009, though many states and cities set higher local minimums. On a 40-hour week over 52 weeks, $7.25 an hour is about $15,080 a year before tax. The Best Answer Hub Salary Converter turns any local minimum into weekly, monthly, and yearly figures instantly.' },
