        <p>None of this makes the arithmetic special, because a conversion is the same everywhere. What differs is what a tool does around the math: whether it shows overtime and the contractor gap, and whether it quietly turns your visit into a lead. The Best Answer Hub Salary Converter does the first and refuses the second.</p>
