        <p class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-bae-border-light text-sm text-bae-muted">Jump into the tools: <a href="/calculators/salary-converter/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Salary Converter</a>, <a href="/finance-toolkit/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Finance Toolkit</a>, <a href="/calculators/compound-interest/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Compound Interest Calculator</a>, and <a href="/tools/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">all Tools</a>.</p>
